# Agriculture RAG — Step 1
This notebook consumes  Step 1 outputs and builds a routed dual-source RAG system.

## Inputs
- `catalog_chunks.csv`
- `chat_chunks.csv`
- `chat_split_manifest.csv` (for leakage checking)

## Main improvements
- Separate catalog and company-chat Chroma collections
- Automatic reuse/rebuild using corpus hashes
- Intent-based source routing
- Product-name filtering
- Clarification guard for ambiguous product questions
- Source-aware reranking and citations
- Retrieval/generation latency logging
- Fair no-retrieval baseline
- Smoke tests and completion checks
